{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38357","headline":"松江晚泊 · 吴融","name":"松江晚泊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树远天疑尽，江奔地欲随。\n孤帆落何处，残日更新离。\n客是凄凉本，情爲系滞枝。\n寸肠无计免，应只楚猿知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}